{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22154","headline":"适意二首 二 · 白居易","name":"适意二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早岁从旅游，颇谙时俗意。\n中年忝班列，备见朝廷事。\n作客诚已难，爲臣尤不易。\n况余方且介，举动多忤累。\n直道速我尤，诡遇非吾志。\n胸中十年内，消尽浩然气。\n自从返田亩，顿觉无忧媿。\n蟠木用难施，浮云心易遂。\n悠悠身与世，从此两相弃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}